## ScannerModal.web.tsx — The Design

**Sanctuary aesthetic + web-superior UX:**

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────┐  ← Modal, Vellum bg (#F5EDD6)
│  [✕]                    Scan QR     │  ← Ink header
│                                     │
│         📱                          │  ← Saffron icon
│    Camera scanning                  │
│    is available in                  │
│    the Gurudevi app                 │  ← Elegant message
│                                     │
│  ┌─────────────────────────────┐    │
│  │  Paste QR code value here   │    │  ← Text input, Ink border
│  └─────────────────────────────┘    │
│                                     │
│        [ Submit Code ]              │  ← Saffron button
└─────────────────────────────────────┘
```

Web users who receive a Gurudevi QR link via email or screenshot can paste the value directly. This is *better* than camera scanning in many school admin scenarios.

